# Conforming GMN fixture: a canonical glyph table. The shipped ⊑ grapheme in the GMN
# script carries a canonical codepoint-explicit spelling (gmeow:gmnCodepoints "U+2291")
# and its operator form is bound to logic:subClassOf through the module's audited
# lang:Denotation record. Two fixture glyphs demonstrate the ONE lawful codepoint reuse:
# they share "U+03BC" (μ) but
# BOTH carry a gmeow:gmnSigilScope, so the sigil-scoped exemption of
# lang:GmnGlyphCollisionShape holds and no collision fires. Every grapheme is grounded in
# the script's repertoire (lang:GraphemeGroundedShape) and every codepoint value is
# canonical (lang:GmnCodepointCanonicalShape / lang:GmnScriptCodepointPresenceShape).

@prefix lang:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix math:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/lang/> .

# ── Exercise the shipped ⊑ glyph in the GMN script's repertoire ─────────────
# Every glyph also carries its measured token-cost feed (gmeow:gmnGlyphTokenCost),
# so lang:GmnScriptGlyphCoverageShape's total glyph-cost coverage stays satisfied.
# The module-owned ⊑ measures three pinned tokens; its canonical denotation target is
# logic:subClassOf, whose grounding correspondence owns the downstream RDFS spelling.
# Reusing that shipped chain avoids inventing a second executable glyph inventory in a
# validation fixture.
gmeow:gmnScript lang:hasGrapheme
    gmeow:gmnGlyphLogicSubClassOf ,
    ex:gMuSigil ,
    ex:gMuMeasure .

ex:qCostOne a math:Quantity ;
    math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ;
    math:quantityValue 1 .

# ── The sigil-scoped exemption: two μ glyphs, one codepoint, both scoped ────
ex:gMuSigil a lang:Grapheme ;
    lang:inScript gmeow:gmnScript ;
    gmeow:gmnCodepoints "U+03BC" ;
    gmeow:gmnGlyphTokenCost ex:qCostOne ;
    gmeow:gmnSigilScope gmeow:gmnSigilMath .

ex:gMuMeasure a lang:Grapheme ;
    lang:inScript gmeow:gmnScript ;
    gmeow:gmnCodepoints "U+03BC" ;
    gmeow:gmnGlyphTokenCost ex:qCostOne ;
    gmeow:gmnSigilScope gmeow:gmnSigilLogic .
